    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d885">

                <pb facs="1018" n="924" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg924"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Olney to Mr.
                            Terrell.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-10-16"><hi rendition="#italic">October 16,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The humane and considerate action of the Sultan’s Government in effecting the
                    departure of wives and children of Armenians in the United States is most
                    cordially appreciated.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Olney.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
